---
import Layout from "@/layouts/main.astro";
---

<Layout 
  title="Shipping & Refund Policy (Draft) - RS Prints"
  description="Shipping timelines, delivery procedures, return conditions, replacement guidelines, and refund policies for customized merchandise."
  canonicalUrl="/shipping-and-refund-policy"
  currentActive="shipping"
>
  <main class="container mx-auto px-4 py-8 md:py-12 max-w-4xl flex-1 flex flex-col gap-8">
    <!-- Header Section -->
    <div class="border-b border-border pb-6">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 mb-3">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider bg-amber-500/15 text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 border border-amber-500/30">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3Z"/>
            <line x1="12" y1="9" x2="12" y2="13"/>
            <line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12.01" y2="17"/>
          </svg>
          Dummy / Placeholder Document
        </span>
        <span class="text-xs text-muted-foreground font-mono">
          Last updated: February 13, 2026 (Draft)
        </span>
      </div>

      <h1 class="text-2xl md:text-4xl font-heading font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground">
        Shipping & Refund Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground mt-2 leading-relaxed">
        Important details regarding production lead times, shipping estimates, return pickups, replacements, and refund processing.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Dummy Flag / Draft Notice Banner -->
    <div class="rounded-xl border border-amber-500/40 bg-amber-500/10 dark:bg-amber-950/20 p-4 md:p-5 flex gap-4 text-amber-950 dark:text-amber-200">
      <div class="shrink-0 mt-0.5">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5 text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/>
          <line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12" y2="12"/>
          <line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12.01" y2="16"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-1 text-xs md:text-sm leading-relaxed">
        <p class="font-semibold text-foreground">
          Notice: Placeholder / Sample Document (Pending Formal Execution)
        </p>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground">
          This Shipping & Refund Policy is an illustrative draft template prepared for staging and preview purposes. All brand names, trade entities, and specific contact channels have been substituted with standard generic placeholders (e.g., <code class="text-xs bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-foreground">[Company Name]</code>). This template is pending final review and formal sign-off by our operations and legal teams.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Policy Content Sections -->
    <div class="text-xs md:text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground space-y-8 font-sans">
      
      <!-- Section 1: Custom Production & Dispatch Timelines -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base md:text-lg font-heading font-semibold text-foreground tracking-wide flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>1.</span> Production Lead Times & Order Processing
        </h2>
        <p>
          Because our products are custom-printed and manufactured to order, each product undergoes design pre-flight checks, high-definition printing, fabrication, and quality assurance before dispatch.
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5">
          <li>
            <strong class="text-foreground">Standard Production Time:</strong> Typically requires <span class="font-semibold text-foreground">2 to 4 business days</span> from the time payment is confirmed and high-resolution print files are verified.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong class="text-foreground">Bulk or Corporate Orders:</strong> May require additional processing days, which will be communicated in advance by our corporate sales team.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong class="text-foreground">Dispatch Notification:</strong> Once your order is packaged and handed over to our logistics partner, an automated confirmation email and SMS containing your consignment tracking link will be dispatched.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 2: Shipping Estimates & Logistics Partners -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base md:text-lg font-heading font-semibold text-foreground tracking-wide flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>2.</span> Shipping Estimates & Coverage
        </h2>
        <p>
          We partner with recognized express logistics carriers to deliver orders across eligible PIN codes.
        </p>
        <div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-border mt-2">
          <table class="w-full text-left text-xs md:text-sm">
            <thead class="bg-muted/60 text-foreground font-semibold border-b border-border">
              <tr>
                <th class="p-3">Delivery Zone</th>
                <th class="p-3">Estimated Transit Time</th>
                <th class="p-3">Typical Delivery Window</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody class="divide-y divide-border">
              <tr>
                <td class="p-3 font-medium text-foreground">Tier-1 Metro Cities</td>
                <td class="p-3">2 – 4 Business Days</td>
                <td class="p-3">Standard Express</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="p-3 font-medium text-foreground">Tier-2 & Tier-3 Cities</td>
                <td class="p-3">4 – 7 Business Days</td>
                <td class="p-3">Standard Road/Air</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="p-3 font-medium text-foreground">Remote / Special Territories</td>
                <td class="p-3">7 – 10 Business Days</td>
                <td class="p-3">Regional Network</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground italic mt-1">
          *Note: Transit times represent business days following dispatch. Estimated arrival dates are indicative and may be subject to delays caused by severe weather, regional road restrictions, or holiday courier backlogs.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 3: Shipping Charges & Order Tracking -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base md:text-lg font-heading font-semibold text-foreground tracking-wide flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>3.</span> Shipping Charges & Live Tracking
        </h2>
        <p>
          Shipping charges are dynamically calculated at checkout based on the total consignment weight, volumetric dimensions, destination PIN code, and selected delivery speed.
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5">
          <li>
            <strong class="text-foreground">Free Shipping Promotions:</strong> May be offered on orders surpassing specified cart thresholds as advertised on the Site.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong class="text-foreground">Consignment Tracking:</strong> You can track your parcel's progress in real-time via the tracking portal link sent to your registered contact address upon dispatch.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 4: Cash on Delivery (COD) Rules -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base md:text-lg font-heading font-semibold text-foreground tracking-wide flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>4.</span> Cash on Delivery (COD) Terms
        </h2>
        <p>
          Where Cash on Delivery is enabled for your PIN code, orders are confirmed subject to automated or telephonic validation. 
        </p>
        <p>
          The total invoice value printed on the courier label must be paid in full (in cash or via courier-accepted UPI/card terminal) upon delivery. Split shipments may occasionally arrive in separate packages with proportional invoices. Non-acceptance of valid COD packages without cause may result in forfeiture of future COD privileges.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 5: Delivery Attempts & Undeliverable Shipments -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base md:text-lg font-heading font-semibold text-foreground tracking-wide flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>5.</span> Delivery Attempts & Return to Origin (RTO)
        </h2>
        <p>
          Our delivery partners make up to <span class="font-semibold text-foreground">three (3) delivery attempts</span> at the address furnished during checkout. Please ensure your shipping address, landmarks, and phone numbers are accurate and reachable.
        </p>
        <p>
          If a delivery fails after three attempts due to customer unavailability, incorrect contact details, or refusal to accept, the parcel will be marked as Return to Origin (RTO). Because customized print merchandise cannot be restocked or resold to other customers, re-dispatching an RTO package will incur actual re-shipping and handling fees.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 6: Cancellation Policy -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base md:text-lg font-heading font-semibold text-foreground tracking-wide flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>6.</span> Order Modification & Cancellation Window
        </h2>
        <p>
          Because our automated manufacturing workflows begin promptly after order receipt, cancellation requests can only be accepted within a strict window:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5">
          <li>
            <strong class="text-foreground">Cancellation Window:</strong> You may request cancellation within <span class="font-semibold text-foreground">2 hours</span> of order placement by contacting our support desk.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong class="text-foreground">Post-Production Ineligibility:</strong> Once an order status advances to "In Production", "Plate Making", or "Printing", cancellations or design file replacements can no longer be accommodated.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 7: Defective Items & 15-Day Claim Window -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base md:text-lg font-heading font-semibold text-foreground tracking-wide flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>7.</span> Quality Guarantee & 15-Day Claims Window
        </h2>
        <p>
          We take immense pride in our craftsmanship and want you to be delighted with your finished products. If you receive merchandise that suffers from a printing defect, physical manufacturing flaw, or transit damage:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5">
          <li>
            <strong class="text-foreground">Reporting Window:</strong> You must notify customer service within <span class="font-semibold text-foreground">15 calendar days</span> of delivery.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong class="text-foreground">Required Evidence:</strong> Please share clear photographs or an unboxing video showing the packaging label, outer box condition, and the specific defect on the item.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong class="text-foreground">Resolution:</strong> Upon verification, <span class="font-medium text-foreground">[Company Name]</span> will either offer an expedited free reprint/replacement or issue a full refund.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 8: Non-Returnable Scenarios (Customer Proofing) -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base md:text-lg font-heading font-semibold text-foreground tracking-wide flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>8.</span> Non-Returnable Scenarios
        </h2>
        <p>
          As personalized custom goods cannot be resold, we cannot accept returns or provide refunds for errors that are outside our production control, including:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5">
          <li>Spelling, grammatical, or typographical errors in text submitted by the user;</li>
          <li>Low resolution, blurry, or pixilated graphics supplied by the customer;</li>
          <li>Customer choice of incorrect sizing, garment color, or phone model casing;</li>
          <li>Normal color variations between on-screen RGB displays and physical CMYK print outputs;</li>
          <li>General buyer's remorse or change of mind after production has begun.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 9: Return Pickups & Warehouse QA -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base md:text-lg font-heading font-semibold text-foreground tracking-wide flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>9.</span> Return Pickup Procedure
        </h2>
        <p>
          If our support team authorizes a return for diagnostic inspection:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5">
          <li>We will schedule a reverse pickup via our logistics partners (up to three pickup attempts).</li>
          <li>Items must be repacked securely in original packaging where feasible.</li>
          <li>Upon receipt at our fulfillment facility, items undergo a standard verification check within 48 hours.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 10: Refund Settlement & Timelines -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base md:text-lg font-heading font-semibold text-foreground tracking-wide flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>10.</span> Refund Processing & Timelines
        </h2>
        <p>
          Once a refund is approved by our billing team:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5">
          <li>
            <strong class="text-foreground">Prepaid Orders (Cards/UPI/Net Banking):</strong> Funds are credited back to the original source account within <span class="font-semibold text-foreground">7 to 10 business days</span>, depending on your bank’s processing cycles.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong class="text-foreground">Cash on Delivery Orders:</strong> Refunds are processed via NEFT / IMPS transfer directly to the verified bank account provided by the customer.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong class="text-foreground">Store Credit Option:</strong> Customers may choose instant store credits, valid for forty-five (45) calendar days from issuance.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong class="text-foreground">UTR Tracking:</strong> Bank reference numbers (UTR / ARN) are provided upon request to assist with bank tracking.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 11: Support & Inquiries -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base md:text-lg font-heading font-semibold text-foreground tracking-wide flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>11.</span> Need Help with an Order?
        </h2>
        <p>
          Our customer care desk is ready to assist you with order status checks, transit queries, and replacement claims:
        </p>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-border bg-card/60 space-y-1.5 text-xs md:text-sm">
          <p><span class="font-semibold text-foreground">Customer Support Desk:</span> [Operations & Support Team]</p>
          <p><span class="font-semibold text-foreground">Email:</span> <a href="mailto:support@yourdomain.com" class="text-primary hover:underline font-mono">[support@yourdomain.com]</a></p>
          <p><span class="font-semibold text-foreground">Helpline:</span> <span class="font-mono">[+91 XXXXX XXXXX]</span> (Monday – Saturday, 9:30 AM – 6:30 PM IST)</p>
          <p><span class="font-semibold text-foreground">Support Portal:</span> <a href="#" class="text-primary hover:underline font-mono">[https://yourwebsite.com/help-centre]</a></p>
        </div>
      </section>

    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
